  "description": "This planning application relates to 42 Whitchurch Road and seeks permission for the construction of a two-storey side extension to provide additional living accommodation in a manner that complements the existing property. As part of the proposed works, the main front entrance door will be repositioned to enhance both the layout and functionality of the dwelling, while maintaining the character of the street scene.\n\nIn addition, the proposal includes the relocation of the garden gate access. The existing access from the footpath will be closed, and a new access point will be created between the garage and the side extension, providing a more practical and secure arrangement for entry into the rear garden.",
